{"projectInfo":{"name":"利用LDP动态建立LSP配置","path":"mpls_ldp","visibility":2,"categoryId":44,"introduction":"Router A、Router B和Router C均支持MPLS。在Router A和Router C之间使用LDP动态建立LSP，使11.1.1.0/24和21.1.1.0/24这两个网段中互访的报文能够通过MPLS进行传输。Router A、Router B和Router C上只允许目的地址为1.1.1.9/32、2.2.2.9/32、3.3.3.9/32、11.1.1.0/24和21.1.1.0/24的路由表项触发LDP建立LSP，其他路由表项不能触发LDP建立LSP，以避免建立的LSP数量过多，影响设备性能。","label":["MPLS"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"RTA","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTC","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"PC-1","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\PC-1.cfg"},{"resourceName":"PC-2","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\PC-2.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTB","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTB.cfg"}]}